"furnizor. Câmpurile SEO au rămas neschimbate."

#: runtime-hardcode-audit
msgid ""
"The primary OpenAI provider has no API billing balance and the single "
"alternate-provider failover also failed. Primary: "
msgstr ""
"Furnizorul principal OpenAI nu are sold API, iar singura comutare la "
"furnizorul alternativ a eșuat. Principal: "

