msgid "Yablonsky AI did not return a conversation identifier for text compute."
msgstr ""
"Yablonsky AI nu a returnat un identificator de conversație pentru calculul "
"text."

#: runtime-hardcode-audit
msgid ""
"The upstream OpenAI provider rejected text compute because its API billing "
